{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["一首赞美诗"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，你是我的 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要尊崇你，我要称赞你的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你以忠信诚实行过奇妙的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就你古时所定的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使城变为乱堆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使坚固城变为荒场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使外邦人宫殿的城不再为城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永远不再建造。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，刚强的民必荣耀你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"强暴之国的城必敬畏你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为当强暴人催逼人的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同暴风直吹墙壁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就作贫穷人的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作困乏人急难中的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作躲暴风之处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作避炎热的阴凉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要压制外邦人的喧哗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像干燥地的热气下落；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"禁止强暴人的凯歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像热气被云影消化。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["神为万民设摆筵席"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在这山上，万军之耶和华必为万民用肥甘设摆筵席，用陈酒和满髓的肥甘，并澄清的陈酒，设摆筵席。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他又必在这山上除灭遮盖万民之物和遮蔽万国蒙脸的帕子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他已经吞灭死亡直到永远。主耶和华必擦去各人脸上的眼泪，又除掉普天下他百姓的羞辱，因为这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到那日，人必说：「看哪，这是我们的 神；我们素来等候他，他必拯救我们。这是耶和华，我们素来等候他，我们必因他的救恩欢喜快乐。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神要刑罚摩押"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华的手必按在这山上；摩押人在所居之地必被践踏，好像干草被践踏在粪池的水中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他必在其中伸开手，好像洑水的伸开手洑水一样；但耶和华必使他的骄傲和他手所行的诡计一并败落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华使你城上的坚固高台倾倒，拆平，直到尘埃。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}